On available
    Say "Master! I've heard that Apple of Moradon has a sticky effect. Let's go and find [Mercenary Supply Officer] Osmond and check it out."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Hello.\nMy name is Osmond. I'm the official Quartermaster for Mercenaries and so on. You're <selfname>, right? I knew it was you- I've heard all the stories! So what brings you here?"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Right now we're in the middle of repairing the wall of Moradon castle, and need lots of cement. Please bring me any Apple of Moradon you have. I will give you a reasonable price for them.\n\nWe are short of the Apples of Moradon to be used for the repair of the castle wall. I will give you appropriate compensation if you bring two Apples of Moradon."

On in_progress
    Say "Shoot... There isn't enough Apple of Moradon for all the repairs."

On ready
    Say "Master! It's the Apple of Moradon! You can trade it to  Osmond at a reasonable price."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Thank you.\nWe were worried about our lack of Apple of Moradon, but this really helps. Thanks again!"
